    narr:narration """Xena ExpertGH's voice on 2026-07-27 is a single, tightly compressed announcement: a database migration from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, framed as a decision already made. She opens with a direct declarative — [Dave voicing the switch](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_2), citing 10x query performance and lower licensing cost — then immediately structures the same content as a [parallel-formatted key-decisions list](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_3): [migration line](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_4), [performance claim](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_5), and [timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1785148094404_6) targeting Q3 2026. The register is matter-of-fact and technical throughout; conviction sits at decision-level, not hedged or exploratory. Power moves are rational-persuasion and expert — she argues with numbers, not authority. The only temporal shift is the timeline line, which moves from present-realis to future-irrealis. There is no dissent, no qualification, no alternative considered — the voice is a closed announcement, not a deliberation.""" ;
